{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","维珀里安"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长生命祭祀的法师，能够造成大量的范围伤害。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","到处都是好材料。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Great materials are everywhere."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我的小宝贝又长大了"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","My little baby keeps growing."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","乖孩子，吃个痛快吧"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Eat your fill, my children."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","实验……不太顺利……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Argh... The experiment... didn't go well..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","……我的小宝贝吃得很饱。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","The experiment was a total success."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","一无所知之人，必将一无所有"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","又有新食物了，乖孩子。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","乖孩子，好了，乖孩子。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","想要得到什么，必先付出代价，这是真理，但反过来可就不一定了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","呵呵……我的小宝贝会喜欢它的……"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","不错的新材料……"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","邪灵蛇影"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","生命的气息被蛇影吮噬。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","冥瞳幽祭"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","为了寻求更高的知识，奉献上更鲜活的祭品，那不可辨别的闪烁目光，究竟来自——"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","幻化商店购买获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","嘶嘶，来做个实验吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","嘶……别打扰我"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","小宝贝们，喜欢这个味道吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","奇妙，我竟然会来到这里……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","要和我的小宝贝打个招呼吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","小宝贝，轮到你与我享用如此美味了……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","嘶——看，那是雪花"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今夜就愉快地冬眠吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/6/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","呼，有些太暖和了……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/7/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有趣的光焰……"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","有人曾看到维珀里安同自己造出的怪物亲密地说话。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","亡灵不需要睡眠，可以全情地投入研究之中，多么精美、高效、可控的种族——维珀里安自己这么形容。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","维珀里安旁若无人地和部下推荐人体改造项目。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","与一般学者不同，维珀里安并不介意和他人分享自己的研究成果，他热衷讨论，喜爱不同的思想碰撞，但很少有人敢听他发表的研究成果。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","维珀里安不需要进食，但他喜欢餐盘，餐桌上的佳肴会为他进行合成研究提供灵感来源。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","维珀里安喜欢新鲜的刺激，任何无趣的试验品都只会被他抛弃。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","维珀里安憎恨希望与梦想。那些无谓的想法会干扰实验品的行为，让实验很难顺利进行。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","维珀里安似乎格外热衷于水生物。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","维珀里安最喜欢看到在分享自己的新发明时，观众厌恶而恐惧的表情。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","由于口出狂言，维珀里安的研究条件与实验资金时常波动。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","哦，维珀里安，最近实验顺利吗？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415019.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","尼汝 & 维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","维珀里安，我知道你在盘算什么，你要做的只有研究班题斯圣器，别有其他念头。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415042.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","霍德希金 & 维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","嘶嘶，来做个实验吧"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415140.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","小宝贝们，喜欢这个味道吗？"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415141.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","奇妙，我竟然会来到这里……"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415335.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","小宝贝，轮到你与我享用如此美味了……"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415336.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","……又到了这个季节。"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415345.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","托安 & 维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","嘶——看，那是雪花"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415455.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","今夜就愉快地冬眠吧"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415456.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","呼，有些太暖和了……"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415633.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","有趣的光焰……"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415634.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","维珀里安"]]}